    <title>EI-Nino</title>
    <link href="http://example.com/2025/02/11/EI-Nino/"/>
    <id>http://example.com/2025/02/11/EI-Nino/</id>
    <published>2025-02-11T09:55:55.000Z</published>
    <updated>2025-06-28T07:56:24.739Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="观测范围"><a href="#观测范围" class="headerlink" title="观测范围"></a>观测范围</h1><ul><li>来自文章《厄尔尼诺和拉尼娜结构不对称机理》<figure class="highlight mathematica"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs mathematica">对观测资料中赤道中太平洋<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-number">5</span>°<span class="hljs-built_in">N</span>—<span class="hljs-number">5</span>°<span class="hljs-variable">S</span><span class="hljs-operator">,</span><span class="hljs-number">160</span>°<span class="hljs-built_in">E</span>—<span class="hljs-number">170</span>°<span class="hljs-variable">W</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span>和赤道东太平洋<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-number">5</span>°<span class="hljs-built_in">N</span>—<span class="hljs-number">5</span>°<span class="hljs-variable">S</span><span class="hljs-operator">,</span><span class="hljs-number">120</span>°—<span class="hljs-number">90</span>°<span class="hljs-variable">W</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span>区域<span class="hljs-operator">...</span><br><br>当标准化 <span class="hljs-variable">DJF</span>（当年 <span class="hljs-number">12</span> 月至次年 <span class="hljs-number">2</span> 月）<span class="hljs-variable">Ni</span>ñ<span class="hljs-variable">o</span> <span class="hljs-number">3.4</span>（<span class="hljs-number">5</span>°<span class="hljs-built_in">N</span>— <span class="hljs-number">5</span>°<span class="hljs-variable">S</span>，<span class="hljs-number">120</span>°—<span class="hljs-number">170</span>°<span class="hljs-variable">W</span>）海表温度异常指数大于 <span class="hljs-number">0.5</span> 个标准差时，选择厄尔尼诺事件<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li><li>文章《全球变暖和厄尔尼诺事件》<figure class="highlight tap"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs tap">特定海域一般采 用 Niño3.4 区（5 °S ～<span class="hljs-number"> 5 </span>°N,<span class="hljs-number"> 170 </span>°～<span class="hljs-number"> 120 </span>°W)。<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li></ul><p>最终采用15°S~ 15°N，120°E~ 80°W作为作图范围</p><h1 id="数据"><a href="#数据" class="headerlink" title="数据"></a>数据</h1><h1 id="参考文章"><a href="#参考文章" class="headerlink" title="参考文章"></a>参考文章</h1><div class="row">    <embed src="全球变暖和厄尔尼诺事件.pdf" width="100%" height="550" type="application/pdf"></div>]]></content>
    
    
    <summary type="html">今年是厄尔尼诺年么？</summary>
    
    
    
